#: data/mate-user-admin.appdata.xml.in:6
msgid "MATE Manager"
msgstr "Gestionari MATE"

#: data/mate-user-admin.appdata.xml.in:7
msgid "Managing Linux Local Users and Groups"
msgstr "Gestion dels utilizaires e dels grops locals de Linux"

#: data/mate-user-admin.appdata.xml.in:9
msgid ""
"Mate Manager is a graphical application that manages local users and groups."
" It can add and delete local users, change user name, user type, user "
"language, user password, automatic login. You can view the user's login "
"record. By working with group-service, groups of users can be managed, such "
"as adding/removing existing groups and creating/deleting new groups."
msgstr ""
"Lo gestionari de Mate es una aplicacion grafica que permet de gerir los "
"utilizaires e los grops locals. Permet d’apondre e de suprimir d’utilizaires "
"locals, de modificar lor nom, lor tipe, lor lenga, lor senhal e lor "
"connexion automatica. Se pòt consultar l’istoric de connexion de "
"l’utilizaire. En collaboracion amb lo servici dels grops, permet de gerir "
"los grops d’utilizaires, per exemple en apondent o en suprimissent de grops "
"existents e en creant o en suprimissent de grops novèls."

